1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,434
Security fills in the NOTOC form and hands the phone to you, the Captain.

2
00:00:05,884 --> 00:00:09,362
The NOTOC for firearms is now signed on a phone.

3
00:00:10,112 --> 00:00:11,436
Here is what changed.

4
00:00:12,236 --> 00:00:15,851
Before, this was a printed paper form, signed with a pen.

5
00:00:16,651 --> 00:00:20,493
Now it is the same form, on the Security officer’s phone.

6
00:00:20,943 --> 00:00:26,308
You sign with your finger, and the signed PDF is saved automatically, in a

7
00:00:26,308 --> 00:00:28,193
restricted AirAsia folder.

8
00:00:28,993 --> 00:00:31,012
Every form works in four steps.

9
00:00:31,462 --> 00:00:34,574
Security fills the form, and hands you the phone.

10
00:00:35,024 --> 00:00:37,689
You check, type your name and ID, and sign.

11
00:00:38,489 --> 00:00:41,817
Then the phone goes back, and Security signs and saves.

12
00:00:42,267 --> 00:00:43,563
Blue is Security.

13
00:00:44,013 --> 00:00:45,077
Orange is you.

14
00:00:45,827 --> 00:00:48,565
You need nothing to install, and no account.

15
00:00:49,015 --> 00:00:50,712
Security brings the phone.

16
00:00:51,162 --> 00:00:54,322
Have your own name and ID or staff number ready.

17
00:00:55,122 --> 00:00:58,720
Read the form before you sign, and if it is wrong, say so.

18
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,137
Sign only for yourself.

19
00:01:01,887 --> 00:01:05,096
This part is for the Captain, the Pilot in Command.

20
00:01:05,546 --> 00:01:10,611
Security fills, the Captain checks and signs, and Security signs and saves.

21
00:01:11,411 --> 00:01:13,492
This is the paper form we used.

22
00:01:13,942 --> 00:01:18,571
Security fills the firearm details, and signs as ‘Loaded by’.

23
00:01:19,821 --> 00:01:25,438
The Captain checks the flight and firearm details, types their own name and ID, and

24
00:01:25,438 --> 00:01:26,859
signs to acknowledge.

25
00:01:28,659 --> 00:01:32,272
In the app, Security fills the form, then hands you the phone.

26
00:01:34,172 --> 00:01:37,085
Tap the orange button marked ‘Captain has the phone’.

27
00:01:38,985 --> 00:01:40,470
Check the flight details.

28
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:46,356
Review every firearm line on the form, and check the ‘Loaded by’ name.

29
00:01:48,356 --> 00:01:52,151
If everything is correct, type your own name in ‘Acknowledged by’.

30
00:01:53,551 --> 00:01:54,985
Enter your ID number.

31
00:01:55,785 --> 00:01:57,508
Sign in the box with your finger.

32
00:01:59,408 --> 00:02:01,509
If you need to sign again, tap ‘Clear’.

33
00:02:02,309 --> 00:02:07,095
If anything in the form is wrong, tap ‘Something is wrong’ and give the phone back

34
00:02:07,095 --> 00:02:08,671
to Security for correction.

35
00:02:10,871 --> 00:02:14,405
When your signature is ready, tap ‘Confirm my signature’.

36
00:02:16,005 --> 00:02:19,338
When the screen says so, give the phone back to Security.

37
00:02:20,688 --> 00:02:23,193
Security signs and saves the record.

38
00:02:23,943 --> 00:02:26,719
This is a real Saved screen from a TEST record.

39
00:02:27,169 --> 00:02:33,168
The app creates the signed PDF, and the Record ID is in the PDF file name.

40
00:02:34,618 --> 00:02:37,572
Security staff email the PDF to you.

41
00:02:38,372 --> 00:02:39,732
Keep it for your records.

42
00:02:40,532 --> 00:02:45,624
Remember: check your name and role on screen, and read the details before signing.

43
00:02:46,424 --> 00:02:48,676
Type your own name and ID if asked.

44
00:02:49,476 --> 00:02:54,108
Sign with your finger, then Confirm, and hand the phone back to Security.

45
00:02:54,908 --> 00:02:58,354
Don’t sign for someone else, or if the details are wrong.

46
00:02:59,154 --> 00:03:02,811
Don’t close the app, press Back, or take photos of the screen.

47
00:03:03,561 --> 00:03:10,228
Your signature goes into one signed PDF per form, with every signature and a Record ID.

48
00:03:10,678 --> 00:03:14,945
It is saved to a restricted AirAsia folder, with a record log.

49
00:03:15,395 --> 00:03:19,935
A PDF copy of the signed NOTOC is shared with you by email.

50
00:03:20,985 --> 00:03:22,041
Have a question?

51
00:03:22,491 --> 00:03:24,531
Ask the Security staff on duty.

